        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Elementary\n- People: Robert Doherty, Jonny Lee Miller, Lucy Liu, Sean Pertwee, Sir Arthur Conan Doyle\n- Roles: Sherlock Holmes, Dr. Joan Watson, Inspector Lestrade, Captain Fitzpatrick, Sergeant Wells, Pilot Smith, Alfred Pennyworth\n- Topics: American procedural drama television series, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- Elementary is an American procedural drama television series that presents a contemporary update of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle's character Sherlock Holmes.\n- Elementary was created by Robert Doherty.\n- Jonny Lee Miller stars in Elementary as Sherlock Holmes.\n- Lucy Liu stars in Elementary as Dr. Joan Watson.\n- Lucy Alexis Liu was born on December 2, 1968, and she is an American actress, voice actress, director, producer, singer, and artist.\n- Sean Pertwee played Captain Fitzpatrick in the play Tom Jones.\n- Sean Pertwee played Sergeant Wells in Dog Soldiers.\n- Sean Pertwee played Pilot Smith in Event Horizon.\n- Sean Pertwee played Inspector Lestrade in CBS's Elementary.\n- Sean Pertwee played Alfred Pennyworth in Fox's Gotham.",
